This repository contains two kinds of material under different terms.

1. SOFTWARE: MIT License

   The MIT License below applies to the software in this repository: the site
   source (src/components/, src/layouts/, src/lib/, src/pages/, src/styles/,
   src/content.config.ts), the scripts/ and tests/ directories (including the
   synthetic fixtures in tests/fixtures/), the .github/ and .devcontainer/
   directories, the build and tooling configuration files in the repository
   root, and the project documentation (README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md,
   AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/README.md, docs/authoring.md,
   docs/decisions.md, docs/previews.md and docs/brief.md).

2. CATALOGUE DATA AND RESEARCH CONTENT: all rights reserved

   The following are NOT covered by the MIT License. No licence to copy,
   redistribute, modify or reuse them is granted:

   - src/content/ (dataset, release and paper records)
   - src/data/ (variables, study uses, samples, quality findings, sources,
     relations, overlaps and curator lists)
   - docs/Kidney_Open_Datasets_and_CV_Papers.md
   - docs/literature/

   Copyright (c) 2026 i-sababishraq. All rights reserved.

   You may read this material in this repository and link to it. Facts about
   third-party datasets and publications remain the property of their
   respective owners; this reservation covers the selection, arrangement,
   annotations and original text of this catalogue.

3. PREVIEW IMAGES (public/previews/) AND THEIR RENDERINGS (figures/)

   Each preview, and the full-size rendering in figures/ it is made from, is
   an adaptation of a third-party dataset (windowed, cropped and outlined) and
   is licensed under that dataset's terms, not under the MIT License and not as
   all rights reserved. The licence, attribution and source of every preview
   are stated in its sample record in src/data/samples/.
   For example, KiTS23 previews are CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (non-commercial, shared
   alike), and UCSF RMaC and CPTAC-CCRCC previews are CC BY 4.0.

4. PAPER FIGURES (public/figures/)

   Each figure is reproduced from a published paper under that paper's own
   licence, which must be CC BY or CC0 (the validator refuses any other). It
   is not covered by the MIT License and not by the reservation in section 2.
   The paper page shows, under each figure, its authors, source, licence and
   any changes, as those licences require; the same details are in the paper
   record in src/content/papers/. Copyright stays with the figure's authors.

5. THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

   Dataset names, licences and descriptions refer to datasets owned by their
   publishers, each under its own terms (see the linked official sources).
   docs/literature/ quotes short citing sentences and abstract sentences from
   published papers, retrieved through the Semantic Scholar API, OpenAlex,
   Europe PMC and DataCite. See docs/literature/paper-candidates.md for the
   attribution those services require. Those excerpts remain subject to their
   authors' and publishers' rights.

